  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, retells a story from 1996 in Varginha, a town in Brazil, drawing on the work of a documentary filmmaker, James Fox. According to Michels, many separate sources describe a cigar-shaped object, something like the Tic Tac, a white oval craft shaped like the mint, falling from the sky with three beings coming out, one of whom was captured and taken to a hospital. He says everyone who worked at that hospital reports having seen the being, which, if true, would mean living non-human creatures were caught and handled by ordinary people."
